cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use multiomeR, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: multiomeR
abstract: >-
  multiomeR is a configurable R pipeline for multi-sample 10x Genomics Epi
  Multiome studies. Starting from Cell Ranger ARC outputs, it performs quality
  control, processing and integration of gene expression and chromatin
  accessibility, and cell-type annotation, with optional modules for
  donor-level differential analyses, peak–gene correlation and genetic
  enrichment of fine-mapped GWAS results. It tracks every step with targets and
  keeps data on disk with BPCells.
